Reverted by known_bugs.sh to reintroduce the bug fixed by b1936ecfe:
voice core: a say released by the close's hard edge keeps its kind: the scheduler's record of it 
went with the release, so the step reported spoken afterwards committed its item as a reply's, 
naming no voice (say_item_after_close_edge, survey seed 114526)

